WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.368
Look at all of these instruments.

2
00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:05.862
Each one is different.

3
00:00:05.863 --> 00:00:10.079
Which one goes clink, clink, clink?

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.994
The chimes go clink, clink, clink.

5
00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:18.737
Which one has black and white keys?

6
00:00:18.738 --> 00:00:23.378
The piano has black and white keys.

7
00:00:23.379 --> 00:00:28.180
Which one goes crash, crash, crash?

8
00:00:28.181 --> 00:00:33.056
The cymbals go crash, crash, crash.

9
00:00:33.057 --> 00:00:36.982
Which one has a long bow?

10
00:00:36.983 --> 00:00:41.007
The violin has a long bow.

11
00:00:41.008 --> 00:00:45.500
Which one has many little cymbals?

12
00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:50.259
The tambourine has many little cymbals.

13
00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:54.897
Which one goes boom, boom, boom?

14
00:00:54.898 --> 00:00:59.310
The drums go boom, boom, boom.

15
00:00:59.311 --> 00:01:03.785
Which one has many colorful keys?

16
00:01:03.786 --> 00:01:08.453
The xylophone has many colorful keys.

17
00:01:08.454 --> 00:01:12.484
Which one is long and thin?

18
00:01:12.485 --> 00:01:16.446
The flute is long and thin.

19
00:01:16.447 --> 00:01:19.930
Which one is your favorite?

